    "@value" : "One step of a sequential recurrence: the expression assigned to a target name. Sequential rather than simultaneous — a later step's expression sees the value the steps above it assigned — which is what lets a reducer's update be authored as ordinary arithmetic instead of with `new_*` temporaries. Authored terse as a `[target, expression]` pair and lifted to this form on load."
  } ],
