    "@value" : "Descriptor for a cached ``ExperimentResult``: the ``.h5`` companion holding the fitted parameter arrays, one ``CachedArray`` entry per array, and the provenance a downstream cache needs to decide whether the result is still valid. Written by ``tvbo.data.experiment_result_io.save_sidecar``, so it is generated rather than authored — but it is self-describing (it carries a ``tvbo_class`` envelope naming this class), which is what lets ``tvbo validate schema`` check a generated sidecar instead of falling back to some unrelated class and failing on its required slots."
