    "@value" : "The operation a ProcedureStep performs. `equation` is the general case (author-written algebra over previously-named intermediates); the others are named graph-construction operations whose options are fields rather than call syntax, so each lowers to a backend-native primitive without an expression string having to survive a parser."
  } ],
