    "@value" : "For a self-projection (source and target are the same population) expanded under a connectivity rule, whether to include the diagonal i->i self connections. Ignored when the source and target populations differ."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
