    "@value" : "How to turn an `image` panel's HTML/URL `source` into its `path`: the headless-browser recipe (viewport, scale, wait, clip). The declarative form of code/capture-screenshots.py, so a screenshot regenerates from the spec instead of being hand-captured. Ignored when `source` is a static file or a script."
