  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Coarse classification of the phenotype bundle, used for filtering in larger study libraries. Canonical values: ``cognitive`` (intelligence / memory / attention scores), ``clinical`` (UPDRS, MMSE, …), ``behavioral`` (raw task outputs), ``demographic``, ``physiological``, ``derived`` (composite scores like g-factor or brain-age). Free string — extend as needed."
  } ],
