  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description" : [ {
    "@value" : "Continues the equilibria of the Jansen & Rit (1995) cortical column in its external input p (pulses per second), from the stable equilibrium it settles to at p = 50 across p in [-50, 400] in both directions, continues the periodic orbits born at every Hopf point it detects, and continues its first fold and its first Hopf point in the plane of p and the connectivity constant C."
  } ],
