  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "External ontology IRIs (typically GO, ChEBI, UBERON, CL, MeSH) that this entity is a surrogate / abstraction / model of. Realized as the `tvbo:surrogate_of` object property, carried inline with the YAML data instance. Multiple IRIs allowed: a single parameter may abstract several biological processes (e.g. a synaptic conductance grounding both GO:0060079 (excitatory PSP) and GO:0007268 (chemical synaptic transmission))."
