    "@value" : "a_1 (JansenRit parameter)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Average probability constant of the number of synapses made by the pyramidal cells to the dendrites of the excitatory interneurons  (feedback excitatory loop). It characterizes the connectivity between the PCs and EINs."
