  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/networks/tpl-fsLR_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-HCPMMP1_den-32k_desc-SCFC_relmat",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description" : [ {
    "@value" : "Group-average HCP connectome on the Glasser HCP-MMP1 atlas (360 cortical + 19 subcortical = 379 nodes). SC = average structural connectivity (streamline weights); FC = HCP1200 average resting-state functional connectivity. Node order is canonical L-cortical, R-cortical, L-subcortical, R-subcortical, Brainstem (identical to the rec-dTOR HCPMMP1 network). Node coordinates are fsLR den-32k midthickness parcel centroids (templateflow) for cortex and MNI152 2mm voxel centroids (Glasser dlabel Atlas_ROIs) for subcortex. Per-node HCP-MMP colours stored as the 'color' parameter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type" : [ {
