    "@value" : "Numeric, string, or boolean value, OR an array (nested list) for array-valued constants such as mode-coupling coefficient matrices. ScalarValue accepts any literal primitive type, allowing parameters to carry control flags (e.g., booleans) or symbolic placeholders alongside numeric defaults."
